# Phase 4 tracer CLI acceptance — structural graph surface (D-11).
#
# Segment 1 of 1 (host-backed, D-13): migrate, then queue the import. The
# harness synchronizes on the host-owned terminal state before the test
# drives activate, graph build, graph inspect, and graph neighbors through
# `qai_out` assertions.

```console
$ qai db migrate
migrations applied; schema version [..]

```

```console
$ qai quran import ../../fixtures/quran/test-edition-min/manifest.json
queued test-edition-min@0.1.0 import as job [..] (state: Queued)
inspect with `qai job show [..]`; `qai serve` processes queued work
note: synthetic test data — non-canonical (ADR-0101 fallback)

```
